  "bookRefs": [
    "R-OLEDB-1",
    "OLE-PROP"
  ],
  "description": "OLE-PROP provider-specific Jet OLEDB properties requested through the connection string (Database Locking Mode 1 and 0, Transaction Commit Mode 1, Global Partial Bulk Ops 2, Encrypt Database True, Database Password wrongpw and empty, Engine Type 5) and through retained Property wrappers set before Open (Database Locking Mode = 1; System database = an absent work file): after Open read the property value, State, Provider and Errors, then Close. Asks which requests are accepted, ignored or refused and what value each reads back.",
